description:
Implement `useComputed` that derives a value from one or more signals created by `createSignal`. The computed value should update whenever any of the provided signals change, and stay stable when none change.

**Example:**
```tsx
const a = createSignal(2);
const b = createSignal(3);

function Sum() {
  const sum = useComputed(() => a.get() + b.get(), [a, b]);
  return <span>{sum}</span>; // 5
}

// When a.set(10), sum becomes 13
```

